TapiocaOptionBroker_forceUnlock.tree
├── when position is expired
│   └── it should revert with LockExpired
├── when user can still lock with debt
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when force unlock is valid
    ├── it should reset position total USDO
    ├── it should calculate correct debt penalty
    ├── it should update penalty fees accrued
    ├── it should transfer remaining USDO to user
    ├── it should remove all market shares
    ├── it should clear position markets array
    ├── it should update total locked USDO
    └── it should emit ExitPosition event
